From f8bc183c13ef36cee7f0c5736af269d61375e7ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eugen <eugen252009@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 10:22:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] authority: enforce scoped filesystem operations through
 VFS

Expose the existing versioned experimental prctl constructor/reduction operations and implement scoped DAC/path, data/namespace checks and truncate/open/handle/fanotify establishment guards. These depend on Core and file-capability helpers from the preceding commits. Preserve existing semantics and native/LSM checks without a new Kconfig switch. This commit also completes the existing ftruncate/fallocate bearer guards alongside path-open/truncate integration. Intermediate series states are not independently qualified.
